  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Release Note v1.0.0\n\n\t\t\tThe launch of the Enterprise Reporting Module within the Muoland ecosystem!\n\t\t\tThis initial release introduces user-friendly interactive pivot tables, designed to enhance your data analysis experience.\n\n\t\t\tKey Features:\n\t\t\t- Seamless creation of interactive pivot tables, powered by generalized N-dimensional multi-hierarchy datacubes\n\t\t\t- User-friendly interface designed for smooth navigation and efficient data analysis.\n\t\t\t- Ability to leave comments on data cubes at any hierarchical level, promoting a culture of collaboration.\n\t\t\t- Automatic data validation and quality checks, including customizable aggregation and allocation rules.\n\t\t\t- Advanced data visualization features for clearer insights and better decision-making.\n\n\t\t\tFor detailed information regarding the terms and conditions of this package, please refer to the LICENSE.txt file.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
